      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a cruel irony that the very future you promised to them now feels like the ultimate theft of their hope. Waiting for balance often only extends the suffering, yet this desperate sense of justice might all you have left to hold onto. Perhaps the only way to honor their memory is to find the strength to let go of the past.",
      "source": "target",
